/data/results/c8s3_tube_prediction/
/data/results/c8s3_tube_prediction_nodisp/
/data/results/c8s3_tube_v2/
/data/results/calibration_c8s3_monomer_with_pl_2modes/
/data/results/calibration_c8s3_monomer_with_pl_omega/

